[　 hello 　]	[　 hello 　]	[　 hello 　]
[ééxhelloxéé]	[ééxhelloxéé]	[ééxhelloxéé]
[x🦆x🦆]	[x🦆x🦆]	[x🦆x🦆]
[🦆hello🦆]	[🦆hello🦆]	[🦆hello🦆]

